  },
  {
    "index": 2490,
    "deltaIndex": 64,
    "source": "for file in /Documents/*.txt; do echo \"$file\"; wc \"$file\"; done\nLoops can be nested (maximum 4 execution levels, 10000 commands per job).\n",
