  {
    "index": 2493,
    "deltaIndex": 67,
    "source": "Terminal Tab5OS\nhelp [command]   pwd   cd [directory]   ls [-al] [directory]\ncat file...   head/tail [-n count] file...   wc file...\ngrep [-in] text file...   find [directory] [-name pattern]\nmkdir [-p] path...   rmdir path...   touch path...\ncp source destination   mv source destination   rm [-r] path...\necho [-n] text...   printf format [text...]   clear\nset name value   unset name   env   test   true   false\nsh/source file.sh [arguments...]   date   df   sleep seconds\nmemory   uptime   wifi   sha256 file...\n\nPaths are relative to the current SD directory. Quote spaces.\nWildcards: * ? [abc]. Variables: $name ${name} $PWD $?.\nSeparate commands with ; or a new line. Conditions: && and ||.\nRedirect: > file or >> file. Errors stay on the console.\nfor f in /Documents/*.txt; do echo \"$f\"; done\nCtrl+C: copy selection, or interrupt when nothing is selected.\nUp/Down: history. Tab: completion. No pipes, background jobs or Bash substitution.\n",
    "english": "Terminal Tab5OS\nhelp [command]   pwd   cd [directory]   ls [-al] [directory]\ncat file...   head/tail [-n count] file...   wc file...\ngrep [-in] text file...   find [directory] [-name pattern]\nmkdir [-p] path...   rmdir path...   touch path...\ncp source destination   mv source destination   rm [-r] path...\necho [-n] text...   printf format [text...]   clear\nset name value   unset name   env   test   true   false\nsh/source file.sh [arguments...]   date   df   sleep seconds\nmemory   uptime   wifi   sha256 file...\n\nPaths are relative to the current SD directory. Quote spaces.\nWildcards: * ? [abc]. Variables: $name ${name} $PWD $?.\nSeparate commands with ; or a new line. Conditions: && and ||.\nRedirect: > file or >> file. Errors stay on the console.\nfor f in /Documents/*.txt; do echo \"$f\"; done\nCtrl+C: copy selection, or interrupt when nothing is selected.\nUp/Down: history. Tab: completion. No pipes, background jobs or Bash substitution.\n",
    "kind": "help"
  },
